# HAT TRICK: the codes (ours) open the unfinished versus pitch, typed on
# the title's CODES screen with the pad: NUTMEG10 plays to 10 goals,
# NUTMEG50 to 50. One ball, two goal mouths; a ball in the left goal is a
# point to the kid on the right. A slide into the kid with the ball knocks
# it loose. While a code is on, nothing is saved and no goal is given,
# until the cartridge is left.
game hattrick
wait 20
expect codes == 0
press DOWN
press DOWN
press A
wait 10
expect state == 2
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press UP
press RIGHT
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
press DOWN
